window.products.push({"id":1103044,"name":"Pythoncidere Incense - 24 Pieces 4-Hour Coil - 100% Natural - D004S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CuUFCEddL._AC_.jpg","description":"This incense is primarily made of heavy-resin Hinoki and other several high-mountain medicinal herbs. This new incense formula contains heavier density of Phytocid, which will make you feel like in green shower when you use it. It won't cause allergy in respiratory system normally. We guarantee there is no extraction of incense essential oil before making this incense, and raw materials are 100% natural. The unique fragrant smell will soothe stress and help relaxation. No matter offering to gods, studying the dharma or for other live recreations, this incense is widely useful and has become one of our most popular incense products. Key ingredients are 100% natural.p.s. Please follow this link to tell how to separate 2 coils: https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/71g8O4DVuzL._SL1005_.jpg***Key Ingredients:+Hinoki (50%) +high-mountain medicinal plants (25%)+several Tibetan Dharma medicines and nectars (15%)+Machilus zuihensis Hayata powder (10%)**Please note:--If you feel too smokey while burning this incense, please open window to keep the air circulation.--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense.--For supporting environmental protection, some of our incense boxes are recycled used in order to reduce waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41CuUFCEddL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B003NVFCYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NVFCYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NVFCYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
