window.products.push({"id":1103278,"name":"SEI Furniture Chantilly Electric Bookcases Fireplace, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B6RrLjvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Boldly ignite your living area with this ornately detailed, classically carved electric fireplace in rich espresso. Bookending shelves echo the molding on the mantel and provide ample storage for reading materials, media accessories, or pottery. In the firebox, glowing faux fire logs add ambiance with flickering LED flames and lifelike embers, with or without heat. Traditional styling combines with modern conveniences to make this handsome fireplace, a must in every home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B6RrLjvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEI Furniture","source_asin":"B07Y8XFW1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y8XFW1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y8XFW1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103279,"name":"Rollease R3 / R8 Roller Shade Installation Brackets (#RB360) 1 PAIR","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kMJzWgu0L._AC_SL1110_.jpg","description":"If you look at your old roll ease brackets you will see a # on the mounting service either #360 or #380 360 is a standard bracket and the 380 is a extension bracket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kMJzWgu0L._AC_SL1110_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RollEase","source_asin":"B00KCX06LI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KCX06LI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KCX06LI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103280,"name":"Churchill China Thanksgiving Turkey Multi Colors Mugs, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5114ZHZ9PYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Thanksgiving Turkey Multi Coloured dinnerware is produced by utilising the centuries old art of transfer printing from an original engravings which bring to life the Turkey which we all associate with the traditional Thanksgiving Holiday. We at Churchill try to bring the best out in our designs by reproducing our ceramics the way our forefathers did in the 18th Century. Each Piece is processed and handled at least 50 times before it is finally made ready for our customers. This vintage feel is applied to the set of four 11.5ounce Mugs, perfect for either Casual or Formal Dining. Manufactured in fine English Earthenware, Thanksgiving Turkey products are both Microwave & Dishwasher safe. This collection is endorsed by Churchill China with its 200 years of history in the manufacture of dinnerware for the home. Amazon.com Churchill, a British producer of tableware for more than 200 years, has thoughtfully created a pattern specifically for the celebration of the most food-focused of American family holidays--Thanksgiving--with a design transfer-printed from an early American copperplate engraving. The Thanksgiving Turkey 12-ounce mugs are meant to be integrated into other matching place setting arrangements in the same pattern. These handled mugs are perfect for coffee or cocoa; on a chilly autumn day, even a mug of soup can be a hand-warming treat. The turkey featured in the Churchill Thanksgiving Turkey design is highly detailed, as if from an antique natural history engraving; the bird stands in full-tailed display amid a cluster of ferns. The subtly fluted mugs sport borders which consist of equally detailed drawings of forest flora: blackberries, acorns, oak leaves, and simple wild rose blossoms. The color palette includes soft blues, reds, golds, and greens in the muted tones of a hand-tinted photograph. The Churchill Thanksgiving Turkey pattern offers a wide range of matching pieces such as basic 5-piece place settings, napkin rings, a cookie jar, a teapot, and a creamer and covered sugar bowl, as well as other individual setting pieces. Churchill earthenware is safe for use in the microwave and freezer; however, avoid rapid temperature changes by allowing dishes to make gradual transitions. Churchill pieces are also dishwasher safe; when hand washing, avoid abrasive cleansers and scourers. Each handled mug in this set of four measures 4-3/4 by 3-1/4 by 4 inches and has a 12-ounce capacity. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5114ZHZ9PYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B0002EXGQO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002EXGQO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002EXGQO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
