window.products.push({"id":1103445,"name":"JOSTYLE 7.5FT Pre-Lit Christmas Tree, Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 UL-Certified LED Lights and 1698 Branch Tips for Indoor Outdoor Christmas Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZzDgQX5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【UL Certificated Pre-lit LED Design】This tree is equipped with 250 LED lights for 6FT, 450 LED lights for 7FT and 550 LED lights for 7.5FT. These small LED bulbs are evenly distributed on each branch, which can make our Christmas tree emit warm and soft white light. All LED light bulbs have passed UL's safety certification to ensure their durability and safety. 【Full & Natural Appearance】Presents a perfect and Natural appearance, this Christmas tree has 1118 tips for 6FT, 1338 tips for 7FT and 1698 tips for 7.5FT which is leafy and fluffy without gaps. Simple green color and high-quality PVC make it look real and beautiful. 【Pine Cones and Red Berries】 With pre-decorated with real large brown pine cones and red berries to make the Christmas tree look more colorful. Our Christmas tree is made of metal hinges, which is very strong and can support any decoration, so that you can design a personalized appearance and bring a warm holiday atmosphere to your family. 【Sturdy Metal Base】Compared with other cheap plastic base, our reinforced metal base will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. Foldable stand with 2' diameter can prevent the tree from tilting or falling. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches. Warning: Please remove the plastic cap which is useless before installation. If damaged or missing when received, not impact any usage effect. 【Simple Setup and Storage】 Put the tree together in just 3 steps, easy to disassemble and store. And the hinged branches will expand easier to save your time and energy. Just arrange it a little, hang the decorations, and a beautiful Christmas tree is finished. 【Fast Delivery & 5 Year Warranty 】Receive SOON .Ship from 13 U.S. based warehouses. All of our products come with a limited 5 year warranty. OVERALL DIMENSIONS: 41\"(Dia) x 72\"(H) for 6FT, 49\"(Dia) x 82\"(H) for 7FT, 51\"(Dia) x 90\"(H) for 7.5FT.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZzDgQX5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOSTYLE","source_asin":"B0B8Z792TZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8Z792TZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8Z792TZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
