window.products.push({"id":1103518,"name":"FUNDOUNS Coffee Mugs,Clear Double Wall Insulated Glass With Handle for Coffee, Tea, Latte, Cappuccino(8 pack,12 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610TzEM2XoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Easy storage Because the Kitchables Tea Cups are scratch- and shatterproof, and stackable, too, they make kitchen storage simpler and easier. Multi-purpose glass cups These are the Tea Cups that can hold your favorite tea, both hot and cold, while they maintain the ideal temperature from your first sip up to the last drop. Double Wall Glasses The double-walled glass is made of heat-resistant borosilicate glass and is hand-blown by professional craftsmen.The double wall structure creates an efficient insulation layer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610TzEM2XoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fundouns","source_asin":"B07VBR862Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBR862Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBR862Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103519,"name":"Progressive International S4 Pyramid Tower Grater with Etched Stainless Steel Grating Surface","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rYFPNE4BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part of Progressive International's S4 line of graters, the uniquely designed Pyramid Tower Grater is perfect for all your basic grating needs. Sharp, straight, simple, and smart, each S4 grater features an etched stainless steel grating surface with Progressive's patent-pending design. The extra-sharp grating surface grates and zests faster, smoother and straighter--resulting in a higher output and less time spent grating. Easy to use and comfortable to hold, the Pyramid Tower Grater includes coarse, medium and fine grating surfaces. The coarse grater is great for basic grating such as cheese for quesadillas, while the medium surface ably grates carrots for salad (both are made of stainless steel). The clear fine grater makes quick work of parmesan, and its face opens to remove grated food--making clean�up easier. The V-style grater blades cause food to move straight down the grater for more efficient grating. Other features include a soft grip knob on top, non-skid feet for stability, and snap-on cover for safe and convenient storage. Dishwasher safe. Food moves down the V-style grater blade for more efficient grating. Clear fine parmesan face opens to remove grated food and easy cleaning. About Progressive International After 38 years in business, Progressive International is still dedicated to creating functional gadgets, tools, food-prep items and household products to make your cooking and meal preparation more efficient and fun. Located in Kent, Washington, Progressive's products are sold in the United States, Canada, Europe, South America, and other international markets. Progressive Makes Cooking Cool More than a workspace, the contemporary kitchen is the heart of the home where we connect with family and friends, and Progressive's philosophy of product design aims to create the perfect balance of form, function and value for your kitchen. The design process pulls from many different research methods such as ethnographic research, consumer testing, surveys, and in-home observations, identifying real life problems in the kitchen that translate to fresh, new ideas for smarter products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rYFPNE4BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B004S67UUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004S67UUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004S67UUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
