window.products.push({"id":1103541,"name":"DURA-GRIP® Non Slip Furniture Pad - RECLINERS - 3/8\" Thick Keep Recliners in Place (25\"-30\" Round)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Dna+TtJL._AC_.jpg","description":"DURA-GRIP is rated as BEST NON SLIP FURNITURE GRIPPER! Our other sizes for other furniture have been top sellers on Amazon and continue to be! NOW STOP YOUR RECLINER FROM MOVING with our DURA-GRIP for recliners - Simply place the gripper pad under recliner base on your hard floor and the recliner stays in place, regardless of use! We offer it in round, square and rectangle based on the actual recliner base. HOW TO GET THE RIGHT SIZE/SHAPE: Order the next largest closest to your base size and in the Gift Message section enter your base size - We will then customize the pad to the right fit for your base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Dna+TtJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DURA-GRIP®","source_asin":"B013WZJ5D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013WZJ5D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013WZJ5D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103542,"name":"Sauces Injector, Meat Tenderizer, Cook Kitchen Tenderizer Tool, 30 Stainless Steel Injection Needle Pinhole, Large 3 oz Marinade Flavor Needle Syringe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311NCb1zS7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Inject All of Enjoyment into Your Every Juicy Bite! Your occasional big meal savior- a must-have kitchen gadget! How many times have you prepared a roast turkey, BBQ'd steak or grilled chicken only to find it dry and flavorless? Such a mess! Frustrating, right?  Well now there's an easy solution! This Meat Injector pumps marinade, wine, spices, garlic, Cajun, brine or pretty much anything you like DIRECTLY INTO the meat to give you the juiciest meals ever.   This Sauces Injector with 2 in 1 Multifunction, 30 stainless steel needles, allows you to safely tenderize and flavorize your meat at the same time. The flavor can easily penetrate the meat, thus reducing the use of seasonings. How do you use this? 1 - You can prepare your favorite marinade first, but it is better not use too large particles preventing blockage. 2 - Inhale the sauce into the injector. 3 - Adjust the mode of the sauce injector according to the thicknes of meat. 4 - Insert sauce injector into the meat. 5 - Press the sauce injector to infuse the sauce.  Cleaned after each use, just soak in warm soapy water after a few minute and wash it with the brush,also you can clean it with dishwasher. Warm Tips: 1 - It is better not use too large particles preventing blockage. 2 - Choose a mode that works for you, otherwise the steel needle will pierce the meat, the sauce will flow out of the meat. 3 - Please read enclosed instructions before use. For your safety, ensure the flavor enhancer is completely locked when not in use. Keep out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311NCb1zS7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHICOC","source_asin":"B08QZ2MQN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZ2MQN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZ2MQN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103543,"name":"Lunch Bags for Women Men Reusable Insulated Thermal Lunch Bag Large 13\"x10.2\"x6.7\" Neoprene Lunch Box Carry Case Handbags Tote with Zipper for Adults ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp51Zq0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSULATED LUNCH BAG - This fashionable lunch bags for women men keeps your food fresh for longer than plastic lunch boxes or paper lunch bags. made of thick neoprene material, can keep food cold or warm for a few hours LARGE CAPACITY - These insulated lunch bags stand upright and stretch to fit all of your lunch containers. The bag measures 13”L x 10.2”H x 6.7”W and fits a variety of foods, drinks and containers,up to 10L. When lunch is over, our lunch totes conveniently fold and lie flat. SECURE ZIPPER CLOSURE & EASY TO CARRY: This lunch tote has a smooth secure zipper closure to keep your lunch inside when you are on the go. The soft grip neoprene handles make it easy to carry. Neoprene stretches for maximum comfort on your fingers. DURABLE & REUSABLE,MACHINE WASHABLE: This lunch bag is reusable and extremely durable, stain, tear and water resistant while being lightweight so it doesn't add to your load. made from machine washable neoprene. No need to worry about accidents and spills inside or outside your tote because you can easily machine wash it on cold and let it air dry. LIFETIME GUARANTEE - These neoprene lunch totes are built to last. Our rock-solid guarantee means we’ll replace your lunch tote if there's ever a problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp51Zq0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"zadanle","source_asin":"B07RN59ZVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RN59ZVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RN59ZVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
