window.products.push({"id":1103763,"name":"Ameritex Sofa Cover, Reversible Quilted Furniture Protector, Ideal Sofa Slipcovers for Pets & Children, Water Resistant, Will Keep Your Couch Stain, D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htqtae8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No matter what type of upholstery fabric covers your sofa, pets, children and daily use may damage it. Dirt, dust and debris cling to any upholstery and typically will not budge until you clean them away. After years of accumulating dirt, your sofa will look dingy, stained and dull. By using the right protection, you can keep your sofa looking good for years to come Our reversible quilted furniture cover offers a comfortable layer of protection with 2 great looks! They rest directly on top of your existing furniture to shield it from spills, stains and those special messes only kids and pets can make Since you don't have to wrap them over furniture, they are just as easy to take off when you want to show off the original look of your sofa. Tired of the color? Just flip it over for a new shade! Quilted construction adds a layer of extra comfort. Soil and snag-resistant covers are also easy machine care What makes us the best choice? Quick set up, simply place over your furniture Machine washable Reversible design to match your decor Water resistant Durable quilted texture Fit most types of furniture Product features: Upholstery Material: Polyester Pieces Included: One Piece Product Care: Machine washable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htqtae8RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameritex","source_asin":"B07CW93M33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CW93M33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CW93M33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103764,"name":"Adjustable Threaded Bed Frame Anti-Shake Tool,Headboard Stoppers,Bedside Antishake Telescopic Support Stabilizer for Room Wall, Beds, Cabinets, Sofas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717jk7A-HIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At night, are you still bothering you or your family about the shaking of the headboard, or are you still worried that the shaking furniture will hurt your wall? Shaking furniture not only makes noise, but also hurts the furniture body because of the frequent shaking. Our bed frame anti-shake tools are your best choice. Effectively reduce noise and protect the wall from damage, prevent sway, calm your mood and improve your sleep quality. Feature 1. Our threaded slides are screwed into place to transform your bed frame in mins, making your bed more stable. 2. This adjustable threaded bed frame anti-shake tool can be used on beds, cabinets, chairs, sofas and other objects that are used against walls. 3 We recommend using 4 antishake tools on the same plane,Install 2 adjustable bed stabilizer each at the top and bottom of the headboard,First tighten the bottom bed shake stopper against the wall, and then tighten the top headboard stabilizer against the wall. Warm Tip 1.Measure the distance between your shaking furniture and the wall before buying, and then choose the appropriate size. 2.Due to manual measurement, there may be some slight differences, sincerely hope you can understand! Thank you! HEADBOARD STOPPERS FULLY BUNDLED PACKAGE INCLUDES: 4 X Assembled Adjustable bed frame anti-shake tool 1 X Extra Double-sided tape 1 X Extra EVA cushion","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717jk7A-HIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FENGTANG","source_asin":"B088ZH6RKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088ZH6RKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088ZH6RKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
