window.products.push({"id":1103786,"name":"Family of 3 Personalized Christmas Ornaments - Santa and Mrs. Claus with 1 Kid Family Ornament - Unique Christmas Keepsake Gifts for Kids, Grandkids, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V7mG9bxgL._AC_SL1051_.jpg","description":"CUSTOMIZE IT YOURSELF - Please kindly note, the ornament doesn't support personalization by seller. You can add your own style and personal touch to the ornament using a permanent marker pen(Recommendation ASIN: B01MZZKTU9), let dry after applying, it will stay on fine. If making mistake, erase it with alcohol or nail polish remover. If you want us to customize the ornament for you, pls VISIT THE MAXORA STORE. MADE OF PREMIUM POLYRESIN - Dimensions: W3-1/3xH4-1/3 inches. We make our personalization ornaments out of premium polyresin that’s both duarable and lightweight, for lasting quality and comes with a red ribbon loop for easily hanging on the wall, door handle or windows, or on your family Christmas tree, to brighten your Christmas décor! MAKE YOUR CHRISTMAS TREES SHINE - With personalized Christmas ornaments that everyone can enjoy. Hand-writing names and handsome blessings add a personal touch, capturing the warmth and excitement of the holidays. Browse our selection and create a holiday tradition the whole family will love for years to come. Whether your family opens gifts Christmas Eve or Christmas Day, let this ornament help you celebrate your holiday tradition in a fun way. UNIQUE HAND MADE CUSTOM GIFTS - Looking for a family present that stands out? What a better way to build your family tradition this holiday season than personalized family Christmas ornaments. Design an ornament for each member of the family, and watch your happy family grow with loving memories along with it and create your own special collection of ornaments. Really perfect Christmas gifts for your neighbors, extended family, friend, church members and grandparents. FREE REPLACEMENT - Something went wrong? Whatever the problem, contact us for a 100% free replacement or full refund! MAXORA specializes in crafting beautiful unique detailed Christmas Ornaments for families and friends to celebrate the holidays and their love for each other, we truly understand the importance of outstanding customer service. Do not hesitate to reach out with even the smallest questions or concerns, we would be delighted to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V7mG9bxgL._AC_SL1051_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXORA","source_asin":"B08G8C9Z3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8C9Z3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8C9Z3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
