window.products.push({"id":1103874,"name":"3-in-1 Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo - 8000Pa Super Suction Robot Vacuum Cleaner with Air Aromatherapy, APP & Alexa Control, Self-Charging, Automatic Sma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ry4IU6ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧹【8000Pa Super Suction Power】The robot vacuum cleaner has 8000Pa strong suction, which picks up dirt and messes easily from the surface and deep within carpet. G1 has 4 levels of suction(8000pa/6000pa/2000pa/1500pa), you can adjust the level of suction according to the degree of dirt. 🏡【3-in-1 Vacuum and Mop Combo】The smart vacuum has a 360ml large water tank and a 500ml dust tank, 3 Levels water flows adjustable, equipped an effective sweeping and mopping configuration, simultaneous dry and wet cleaning, which makes your house cleaning more thorough. Ideal for pet hair/carpets/hard floors/wood floor and other different floor.（The 500ml dust bin only needs to be emptied once in two weeks) 🐕【Robot Vacuum for Pet Hair】The robot vacuum for pets integrates scissors into the built-in roller brush. Allowing this robotic vacuum cleaner to cut the pet hair inhaled automatically, avoiding winding the roller brush.The brushless suction port won't get clogged with pet hair like other robot vacuums with roller brushes.Bilateral brush can quickly clean the daily dirt and the pet hair in your home such as the scum and food debris. 📱【APP & Alexa Control】This robotic vacuum can be controlled by the Tuya APP, which can be downloaded on Andriod or IOS app store. (When G1 robot vacuum cleaner is started, the smart mapping function will start automatically, it will automatically draw the cleaning route in the house and work).Can remotely open and clean the house or Schedule cleaning time on the APP. Alexa and Google assistant supported, just open your mouth can let the robotic vacuum work. (APP only supports 2. 4GHz Wi-Fi,not applicable for 5G Wi-Fi.) 🤖️【Auto Mapping Function】 G1 robot vacuum will automatically recognize your home and create a smart map when you start the machine.The default cleaning route is I-shaped cleaning. You can check where it has cleaned in the map that builds up in-app. When you want G1 to work in your designated area, you can choose \"Spot Cleaning\" on the APP. ( WARM TIP: We recommend that you let the robot work several times. When it is familiar with the layout of your home, the robotic vacuum will work more thoroughly.) 🔋【110 Mins Running Time & Self-charging】The robotic vacuum cleaner offers four levels of intensity adjustment(max/strong/normal/quiet), adjustable for different floor types, can continuously work 110 minutes working time under quiet mode, and will automatically back to the charging base and recharge when the battery is Low than 20%. ( Please install the charging station according to the user manual to prevent the robotic from being unable to recognize the location of the charging station) 🎁【Perfect Present Chocie】A great robot vacuum will keep your carpets and hard fllors free of hair, dust and debris. APP remote control, voice control with Alexa, and touch open are all available. It is a prefect Christmas/Birthday/Thanksgiving gift for families with pets! 💖【Free Return】30-Day Free Return Guarantee! 12-Month Worry-free Warranty! Packages include 1x G1 Vacuum Cleaner, 4x Side Brushes, 1x water tank included 2x mop cloths, 2x Solid Aromatherapy(can DIY), 1x Charging Dock, 1x Power Adapter, 1x Mopboard, 1 x User Manual. If your G1 robot vacuum cleaner has any problem, we are standing by to answer your questions. 🌸【Air Aromatherapy Function】G1 vacuum cleaner robot has a specially designed imported HEPA filter, the air outlets on both sides will discharge the fragrance while cleaning, which can improve dander, dust, odor and so on. Effectively improve indoor air quality and give you a clean living environment.(Two aromatherapy strips included in the package, and you can also DIY your favorite aroma)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ry4IU6ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Faminode","source_asin":"B0C4TTDSCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TTDSCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TTDSCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
