window.products.push({"id":1103916,"name":"Apple Slicer 12 Slices, Upgraded Version 12-Blade Extra large Apple Cutter, Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Apple Corer, Fruit Cutter, Ultra Sharp Apple Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LHYVtRNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎UPDATED APPLE SLICERS: In the 12-Blade Extra Large apple slicer and corer, each blade has four welding points that are tightly connected to the central core ring, making it more durable and suitable for daily use. The sharp blade is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel, providing you with the most precise fruit-cutting experience. 🍎IDEAL KITCHEN HELPER & GOOD GRIP: Slicing apples is a time-consuming task. However, with the Kitchen Apple corer tool, you can now make healthy apple snacks in seconds for yourself, your family, and your friends. With the Good Grips Apple slicer core cutter, you can easily core and slice apples. Sharp, stainless steel blades slide quickly through fruit and deliver beautiful apple slices, while soft, broad handles take the pressure off your hands. 🍎 HIGH QUALITY, CORE AND SLICE: This upgraded apple cutter 12 slices blade has a nice design. One simple action, allows you to cut fruits into 12 consistent slices. This thin Apple Slicer is LARGE, measuring 4.2 inches in length. Non-Rusting and Non-Magnetic. The extra-large handle is easy to control, resulting in a satisfying fruit-cutting experience. 🍎 EASY TO CLEAN: Without any plastic, everything in the apple core slicer is composed of heavy-duty stainless steel. Please mind the sharp blades and clean them with the brush after using them. To extend the product's lifespan, clean it with warm water and a cleaning brush after each use and wipe dry with a cloth or air dry it. 🍎 Our Customer Service Promise: Our 12 blade apple slicer corer cutter heavy duty comes with a lifetime warranty. But, If there are any issues with the Slicer, just contact us and we will make it right. We will solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LHYVtRNzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTLS","source_asin":"B0C1RCSFFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1RCSFFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1RCSFFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
