window.products.push({"id":1103970,"name":"Hercaise Wine Openers Set All-in-one Wine Opener with Wine Corkscrew, Bottle Opener, Foil Cutter, Wine Vacuum Stopper, Double Lever Corkscrew Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y-lApXsUL._AC_SL1035_.jpg","description":"Do you need a lot of power to pull out the wine stopper? Do you need a versatile portable bottle opener that can open any wine? Are you worried that drinking the remaining wine will lose its original taste? Are you also looking for a practical gift? Please purchase this wine corkscrew kit, it will bring many conveniences to your life.It will come in handy in any occasions, such as friends gathering, family gathering, road trip, evening drink, BBQ, outdoor play, etc. If you think these are its all functions then you are wrong, multifunctional bottle opener can not only be used to open wine , White wine, beer and other bottled wine, its foil cutter can also pry open cans, dismantle express, etc. please use it innovatively and to maximize the effectiveness of the product.At the same time, we also have exquisite customized packaging, which is also a great choice for gifts. ABOUT MATERIALS: -WAITER CORKSCREW: Stainless Steel-VACUUM WINE STOPPER: Silica Gel and Plastic ABOUT PRODUCT: -PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 Waiter Corkscrew1 Vacuum Wine Stopper-PACKAGE: Box with Phnom Penh Snow Yarn Decoration Bow-knot-COLOUR: Black Silver Blend SPECIFICATIONS: -LENGTH: Waiter Corkscrew Approx.12cmVacuum Wine Stopper Approx.8.5cm-WEIGHT: 0.15kg","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y-lApXsUL._AC_SL1035_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hercaise","source_asin":"B08CKMBFXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKMBFXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKMBFXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103971,"name":"Om Gallery Capiz Shell Lotus Tea Light Holder, Mango","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TOQNXCT5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each Paradise tea light holder is designed in the shape of an open lotus flower, with three rings of translucent capiz shell petals. Universally recognized as a symbol of peace and serenity, this handcrafted tea light holder is a glorious, soothing interplay of light and color. Each shell is painted only around the edges, creating a unique interplay of light and color. Base is painted same color as shell, brass edge strips are neutral.  Use with a white or colored tea light to create a soothing peaceful ambiance. Perfect for meditation and yoga practice, relaxation and spa, or home accent. Designed to be placed on any flat surface. Handmade in the Philippines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TOQNXCT5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Om Gallery","source_asin":"B00K3O3ECO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K3O3ECO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K3O3ECO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1103972,"name":"APPO Fountain Lamp, Solar Power Generation, Star Bath Garden Art Lamp Decoration, Led Waterproof Lamp Strip, Used for Garden Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVf9RoWFS._AC_SL1444_.jpg","description":"Solar spout lamp creates a unique visual atmosphere for your garden, just like you live in a fairy tale.Solar panels and led strings are waterproof, so there is no need to worry about safety.The stored light energy can work for LED strings for at least 6-8 hours.Garden lamp posts have a protective coating, so they can maintain their service life in the next few years. The LED strip provides a beautiful graphic effect and will illuminate any background with a beautiful decorative shadow effect.Sprinkle the fountain pot with fairy light in your garden, and create a unique focus in the dark garden by releasing a series of very slight lights.The battery pack is kept dry on the internal hook and the bracket is removable for assembly.Material: IronProducts include:1 iron frame1 sprinkler1 LED light","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVf9RoWFS._AC_SL1444_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"APPO","source_asin":"B095BR2JXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1103972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095BR2JXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095BR2JXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
